+@section rv565
+
+RV565 muxer.
+
+This muxer writes video for microcontroller displays. It requires a seekable
+output and a single RV565 video stream.
+
+@table @option
+@item format_version @var{version}
+The format version to write, 6 or 7. Version 6 holds only zlib-compressed
+@samp{rgb565be} keyframes, at most 30 frames per second, for players older
+than RV565 2.0. Default value is 7.
+@end table
+
 @anchor{segment}
 @section segment, stream_segment, ssegment
 
